                                                    12 ***********************************************************************
                                                    13 *
                                                    14 *        basic instruction tests
                                                    15 *
                                                    16 ***********************************************************
                                                    17 *  This program tests proper functioning of the PLO-Extension
                                                    18 *  facility functions with ACCESS-REGISTER mode. Specification
                                                    19 *  exceptions are not tested.
                                                    20 *
                                                    21 *  PLEASE NOTE that the tests are very SIMPLE TESTS designed to catch
                                                    22 *  obvious coding errors.  None of the tests are thorough.  They are
                                                    23 *  NOT designed to test all aspects of any of the instructions.
                                                    24 *
                                                    25 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    26 * Programmer's Note:
                                                    27 *
                                                    28 * The following tests have a LOT of duplicate (copy/paste) code
                                                    29 * to allow for minor modifications specific to each test.
                                                    30 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    31 *
                                                    32 ***********************************************************************
                                                    33 *
                                                    34 *  Example Hercules Testcase:
                                                    35 *
                                                    36 *    *Testcase "plo-02-extension-armode
                                                    37 *    *
                                                    38 *    *   PLO-Extension Functions Facility tests
                                                    39 *    *
                                                    40 *    *   # ------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    41 *    *   #  This tests only the basic function of the instruction.
                                                    42 *    *   #  Exceptions are NOT tested.
                                                    43 *    *   # ------------------------------------------------------------
                                                    44 *    *
                                                    45 *    mainsize    2
                                                    46 *    numcpu      1
                                                    47 *    sysclear
                                                    48 *    archlvl     z/Arch
                                                    49 *
                                                    50 *    loadcore    "$(testpath)/"plo-02-extension-armode.core.core" 0x0
                                                    51 *
                                                    52 *    diag8cmd    enable    # (needed for messages to Hercules console)
                                                    53 *    runtest     5         #
                                                    54 *    diag8cmd    disable   # (reset back to default)
                                                    55 *
                                                    56 *    *Done
