                                                  1105 ***********************************************************************
                                                  1106 *     Macros to help build test tables
                                                  1107 ***********************************************************************



                                                  1109 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1110 * TSTLBL : insert a label with a test number suffix
                                                  1111 *          - &name: the label name
                                                  1112 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1113 *                                  eye catch (32 bytes) for octo check
                                                  1114          MACRO
                                                  1115          TSTLBL  &NAME
                                                  1116          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                  1117          LCLC  &X
                                                  1118 &X       SETC  '&NAME&TNUM'
                                                  1119          DC    CL32'PRI   >>>&X<<<'      eye catcher
                                                  1120 &X       DS    0C
                                                  1121          MEND
                                                  1122
                                                  1123 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1124 * TSTEND : end a test
                                                  1125 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1126          MACRO
                                                  1127          TSTEND  &NAME
                                                  1128          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                  1129 TEND&TNUM  DC  CL32'PRI   END of test: &TNUM <<<'
                                                  1130          MEND
                                                  1131
                                                  1132 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1133 * TSTCODE : The code for the test follows the label
                                                  1134 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1135          MACRO
                                                  1136          TSTCODE  &NAME
                                                  1137          GBLA  &TNUM
                                                  1138          LCLC  &X
                                                  1139 &X       SETC  'CODE&TNUM'
                                                  1140 &X       DS    0F
                                                  1141          MEND
                                                  1142
                                                  1143 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1144 * TSTDATA: The data for the test follows.
                                                  1145 *          Data is aligned to the 1.5K boundary after the TSTHDR
                                                  1146 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1147          MACRO
                                                  1148          TSTDATA  &NAME
                                                  1149          GBLA  &THDRNUM
                                                  1150          ORG   PLOETST+(128*K)+&THDRNUM*(3*K)+(K+512)
                                                  1151          MEND
                                                  1152
                                                  1153 *----------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                  1154 * TSTHDR: The start of a PLOE function test
                                                  1155 *         Test is aligned to 3K boundary
                                                  1156 *              (1.5K data/code; 1.5K instruction test data)
                                                  1157 *
                                                  1158 *        Note: PLOETEST DSECT needs to be in-sync with TSTHDR
ASMA Ver. 0.7.0  plo-02-extension-armode                                                            23 Oct 2026 22:47:02  Page    33

